<header><p class="enc-kicker">Person</p><h1 class="enc-title">Mac Mau Hop</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates">d. <a href="/years/1592">1592</a></span> · <a href="/centuries/16th-century">16th century</a> · Also known as Mạc Mậu Hợp</p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Mac Mau Hop was emperor of the Mac dynasty of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/vietnam">Vietnam</a> from 1562 to 1592. His reign was dominated by war with the restored Le dynasty and its Trinh lords. In 1592 <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/trinh-tung">Trinh Tung</a> captured <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/thang-long">Thang Long</a>, and Mac Mau Hop was taken and executed; surviving members of his family withdrew to <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/cao-bang">Cao Bang</a>.</p><figure class="enc-fig"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/mac-mau-hop.jpg" alt="Mac Mau Hop" width="320" height="427" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption>Image: 大南曆大龍飛圖 · CC0 · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Statue_of_Emperor_M%E1%BA%A1c_M%E1%BA%ADu_H%E1%BB%A3p.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure></div>
